  "solution": {
    "text": "Average time for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> collision to occur on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> wall,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></math>. Change in momentum in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> collision <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math>. Average force on each support,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.",
